    "fields": {
      "title": "A Journey Through the Swiss Alps",
      "description": "The Swiss Alps are known for their majestic views and breathtaking landscapes. This journey takes you through picturesque villages, snowy peaks, and serene lakes. Whether you're hiking, skiing, or simply enjoying the view, the Swiss Alps are an experience that everyone should have at least once in their lifetime.",
